<title>SWITZERLAND: ARES-SERONO H1 NET PROFIT JUMPS 99.5 PCT.</title>
<headline>ARES-SERONO H1 NET PROFIT JUMPS 99.5 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>				    (million dollars unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net income	     41.106	    vs 20.609</p>
<p> Earnings per share, dollar    10.97	     vs 5.50</p>
<p> Sales			    437.563	   vs 375.881</p>
<p> Cost of sales		  131.781	   vs 133.832</p>
<p> Gross margin		   305.782	   vs 242.049</p>
<p> Total operating expenses   235.776	   vs 196.389</p>
<p> Operating income	     74.393	    vs 44.008</p>
<p>Results for three months ended June 30 vs same 1996 period:</p>
<p> Net income		     24.658	    vs 11.949</p>
<p> Operating income	     38.859	    vs 22.063</p>
<p> Earnings per share, dollar    6.58		vs 3.19</p>
<p> Net sales			225.570	   vs 200.135</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is The Ares-Serono Group.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
